s_tactile_sensations"},{"name":"Stimulation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Stimulation"},{"name":"Symmetrical texture repetition","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Symmetrical_texture_repetition"},{"name":"Tactile enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Tactile_enhancement"},{"name":"Thought acceleration","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_acceleration"},{"name":"Thought disorganization","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_disorganization"},{"name":"Thought loops","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_loops"},{"name":"Time distortion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Time_distortion"},{"name":"Tracers","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Tracers"},{"name":"Transformations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Transformations"},{"name":"Wakefulness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Wakefulness"},{"name":"Euphoria"},{"name":"Empathy"},{"name":"Insight"},{"name":"Brightened colour"},{"name":"Closed/Open eye visuals"},{"name":"Enhanced tactile sensation"},{"name":"Mental/physical stimulation"},{"name":"Decreased appetite"},{"name":"Restlessness"},{"name":"Change in perception"},{"name":"Ego softening"},{"name":"Sweating/chills"},{"name":"Muscle tension"},{"name":"Confusion"},{"name":"Insomnia"}],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Methallylescaline"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/methallylescaline"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_Methallylescaline.shtml"},{"title":"PiHKAL Entry","description":"Alexander & Ann Shulgin phenethylamine monograph","url":"https://www.erowid.org/library/books_online/pihkal/pihkal099.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methallylescaline"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on Methallylescaline","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6823556"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E7%94%B2%E5%9F%BA%E7%83%AF%E4%B8%99%E5%9F%BA%E9%BA%A6%E5%8F%B8%E5%8D%A1%E6%9E%97"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/%E7%94%B2%E5%9F%BA%E7%83%AF%E4%B8%99%E5%9F%BA%E9%BA%A6%E5%8F%B8%E5%8D%A1%E6%9E%97"}],"wikidata":"Q6823556","formula":"C14H21NO3","molarMass":251.32,"pharmacology":{"text":"Methallylescaline acts as a potent agonist of the serotonin 5-HT2A, 5-HT2B, and 5-HT2C receptors, among other actions. It was inactive serotonin 5-HT2B receptor agonist in one study, but was a potent agonist in another study. The drug is also a potent agonist of the serotonin 5-HT1 receptors and of the serotonin 5-HT5A receptor, as well as an agonist of the dopamine D3 receptor.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Methallylescaline","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methallylescaline#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Serotonin receptor modulator; Serotonin 5-HT2A receptor agonist; Serotonergic psychedelic; Hallucinogen","figures":"Methallylescaline"},"uses":{"text":"It was encountered as a novel designer drug by 2013.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Methallylescaline","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methallylescaline","routes":"Oral","figures":"Methallylescaline"},"zh":"甲基烯丙基麥司卡林","zhHans":"甲基烯丙基麦司卡林","zhHansOther":"甲基烯丙基麥司卡林","summaryZh":"甲基烯丙基麥司卡林是一種含氮有機化合物，分子式C14H21NO3，屬於苯乙胺衍生物中的3,5-二甲氧基苯乙胺衍生物（「司卡林類化合物」），為一種策劃藥，2024年被列入《非藥用類麻醉藥品和精神藥品名錄》。","summaryZhHans":"甲基烯丙基麦司卡林是一种含氮有机化合物，分子式C14H21NO3，属于苯乙胺衍生物中的3,5-二甲氧基苯乙胺衍生物（“司卡林类化合物”），为一种策划药，2024年被列入《非药用类麻醉药品和精神药品名录》。","ai":{"by":"Claude (Anthropic)","date":"2026-11-27","sideEffects":{"en":"Little is known about it in people. Psychedelic phenethylamines related to it can cause nausea, anxiety, confusion, a faster heart rate and raised blood pressure, and may trigger psychosis in people prone to it.","zh":"目前對它在人體的作用所知甚少。相關的迷幻苯乙胺類可能引起噁心、焦慮、混亂、心跳加快與血壓上升，也可能誘發易感者的精神病。","zhHans":"目前对它在人体的作用所知甚少。相关的迷幻苯乙胺类可能引起恶心、焦虑、混乱、心跳加快与血压上升，也可能诱发易感者的精神病。"},"fact":{"en":"Methallylescaline is mescaline with a methallyl group, a small branched carbon chain with a double bond, attached to the middle oxygen in place of a methyl. Shulgin described it in PiHKAL.","zh":"甲基烯丙基麥司卡林是把麥司卡林中間氧原子上的甲基換成甲基烯丙基，這是一條帶雙鍵的小型分支碳鏈。舒爾金在《PiHKAL》中描述過它。","zhHans":"甲基烯丙基麦司卡林是把麦司卡林中间氧原子上的甲基换成甲基烯丙基，这是一条带双键的小型分支碳链。舒尔金在《PiHKAL》中描述过它。"}}}